{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux sshd拉起异常子进程。对应需求：持久化。官方：Unusual SSHD Child Process。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux sshd拉起异常子进程","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux sshd拉起异常子进程\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://hadess.io/the-art-of-linux-persistence/"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"4c3c6c47-e38f-4944-be27-5c80be973bd7","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:linux and event.type:start and event.action:(exec or ProcessRollup2) and\nprocess.parent.name:sshd and process.args_count:2 and process.parent.args:\"-D\" and\nnot (\n  process.command_line:(-bash or -zsh or -sh) or\n  process.name:(ractrans or exectask or tty or tput or ferny-askpass or id or ip) or\n  process.executable:/var/tmp/foreman-ssh-cmd*/script\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1133","name":"External Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1133/"},{"id":"T1546","name":"Event Triggered Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1546.004","name":"Unix Shell Configuration Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1021.004","name":"SSH","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/004/"}]},{"id":"T1563","name":"Remote Service Session Hijacking","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1563/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1563.001","name":"SSH Hijacking","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1563/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1133","name":"External Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1133/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["process.executable"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":8,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
